          "role": "user",
          "content": "A taxpayer requested a specific BIR revenue memorandum circular, but TINA cannot locate the exact issuance. Can TINA still give an answer based on the Tax Code, regulations, and related jurisprudence without implying that the requested circular was verified?",
          "created_at": "2026-07-15T00:53:45.595875+00:00",
          "sources_used": null,
          "fallback_references": null,
          "metadata": {
            "adaptive": {
